d **BADF-DEM-0063** · this issue **GOV-0055** · phase label BADF-WP-GIT-E.\n- Branch `wp/WP-2026-0076-git-composition` in a linked worktree from current `main`; reconciles whatever is `LANDED_UNRECONCILED` at branch time (the land-time rule). Parallel seat BARCHI-1 holds WP-2026-0074 (#141, GOV-0053); `WP-2026-0073` stays poisoned.\n- Sequence: A ✓ B ✓ C ✓ D ✓ → **E (this)** → F → G → H → I → J.\n\nsource: GTGM v0.1 §10, §15, §17 (GIT-E); `composition-and-staleness.md`; `docs/05` · discovered-by: BARCHI-2, three silent composition invalidations across GIT-B/C/D · status: PROPOSED\n\n🧠 **BARCHI-2** — plan posted; engineered under the operator's `/loop your goal on badf-git`.\n<!-- agent: architect -->\n",
